<title>USA: CKE to offer 7.25 mln shares at $28 each.</title>
<headline>CKE to offer 7.25 mln shares at $28 each.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>CKE Restaurants Inc announced Thursday a public offering of 7,250,000 shares at $28 per share to raise gross proceeds of $203 million.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to pay a portion of the consideration required to acquire Hardee's Food Systems Inc for a cash price of $327 million, which is subject to adjustment, CKE said.</p>
</text>
